sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 actor U as Verified student
 participant API as Join Request API
 participant S as submit_join_request
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 U->>API: POST /api/v1/parties/{id}/join-requests + CSRF
 API->>API: Guard, validate method/body
 API->>S: party_id, trusted user
 S->>DB: BEGIN, lock Party
 S->>S: Read clock, reject cancelled/started/full, Host or active member
 alt Not eligible
 S->>DB: ROLLBACK
 S-->>API: JoinRequestError
 API-->>U: 404 / 409 (guard errors 401/403)
 else Eligible
 S->>DB: Lock/get_or_create request under unique(party,user)
 alt Existing Pending or invalid Approved history
 S->>DB: ROLLBACK
 API-->>U: 409
 else New request or permitted reopening
 S->>DB: Save Pending, clear decision on reopen, COMMIT
 S-->>API: Request
 API-->>U: 201 Pending
 end
 end
 Note over S,DB: No membership insertion or seat reservation, US10 approval is separate
